<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Melody in the sky"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ろん"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="事務員G"/><amll:meta key="album" value="空中さんぽ"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="26112204"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Mrs4s"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:47.158"><div begin="0.903" end="5:47.158"><p begin="0.903" end="3.400" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="0.903" end="1.330">はい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1.330" end="1.803">いろ</span></span></span><span begin="1.803" end="2.153">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2.153" end="2.863">そら</span></span></span><span begin="2.863" end="3.043">か</span><span begin="3.043" end="3.400">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">从灰暗的天空中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">haiiro no sora kara</span></p><p begin="3.683" end="6.200" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">落</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3.683" end="3.853">お</span></span></span><span begin="3.853" end="4.063">ち</span><span begin="4.063" end="4.403">て</span><span begin="4.403" end="4.623">き</span><span begin="4.623" end="4.853">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.853" end="5.843">しずく</span></span></span><span begin="5.843" end="6.200">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">飘落而下的雨滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ochite kita shizuku de</span></p><p begin="6.513" end="11.508" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今、</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.513" end="8.648">いま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.193" end="9.713">こころ</span></span></span><span begin="9.713" end="10.073">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">滲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.073" end="10.620">にじ</span></span></span><span begin="10.620" end="10.933">ん</span><span begin="10.933" end="11.508">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">此刻晕染了我的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ima, kokoro ga nijinda</span></p><p begin="12.193" end="14.740" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">黒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.193" end="12.523">くろ</span></span></span><span begin="12.523" end="12.900">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">彩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.900" end="13.763">いろど</span></span></span><span begin="13.763" end="14.123">ら</span><span begin="14.123" end="14.323">れ</span><span begin="14.323" end="14.740">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因那被涂满漆黑的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuroku irodorareta</span></p><p begin="15.023" end="17.540" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">高</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.023" end="15.400">たか</span></span></span><span begin="15.400" end="15.713">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">壁</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.713" end="16.253">かべ</span></span></span><span begin="16.253" end="16.613">の</span><span begin="16.613" end="16.920">せ</span><span begin="16.920" end="17.143">い</span><span begin="17.143" end="17.540">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">高墙阻隔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">takai kabe no sei de</span></p><p begin="17.863" end="22.798" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="17.863" end="18.633">ひかり</span></span></span><span begin="18.633" end="19.060">さ</span><span begin="19.060" end="19.580">え</span><span begin="19.580" end="19.933">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.933" end="20.120">み</span></span></span><span begin="20.120" end="20.493">え</span><span begin="20.493" end="20.960">な</span><span begin="20.960" end="22.798">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">连光芒也无从窥见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hikari sae mo mienai</span></p><p begin="29.123" end="34.420" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.123" end="29.273">こ</span><span begin="29.273" end="29.463">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">街</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.463" end="29.980">まち</span></span></span><span begin="29.980" end="30.320">は</span><span begin="30.320" end="30.663">い</span><span begin="30.663" end="30.953">つ</span><span begin="30.953" end="31.243">し</span><span begin="31.243" end="31.780">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.880" end="32.380">いろ</span></span></span><span begin="32.380" end="32.763">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">失っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.763" end="33.893">うしなっ</span></span></span><span begin="33.893" end="33.970">て</span><span begin="33.970" end="34.073">い</span><span begin="34.073" end="34.420">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这座城市不知何时已失去了色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono machi wa itsushika iro o ushinatte ita</span></p><p begin="34.753" end="39.868" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.753" end="35.060">で</span><span begin="35.060" end="36.930">も、</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.443" end="37.753">だれ</span></span></span><span begin="37.753" end="37.923">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.923" end="38.253">き</span></span></span><span begin="38.253" end="38.473">づ</span><span begin="38.473" end="38.773">か</span><span begin="38.773" end="39.160">ず</span><span begin="39.160" end="39.868">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">可却无人察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo, dare mo kizukazu ni</span></p><p begin="40.363" end="45.680" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.363" end="40.533">時</span><span begin="40.533" end="41.100">計</span><span begin="41.100" end="41.323">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.323" end="41.993">うご</span></span></span><span begin="41.993" end="42.363">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.363" end="42.473">だ</span></span></span><span begin="42.473" end="43.223">す</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.223" end="43.940">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="43.940" end="44.173">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.173" end="44.843">うご</span></span></span><span begin="44.843" end="45.213">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.213" end="45.360">だ</span></span></span><span begin="45.360" end="45.680">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">时钟开始转动 我也迈开脚步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tokei wa ugokidasu watashi mo ugokidasu</span></p><p begin="46.063" end="55.340" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.063" end="46.773">いた</span></span></span><span begin="46.773" end="46.973">み</span><span begin="46.973" end="47.320">さ</span><span begin="47.320" end="47.853">え</span><span begin="47.853" end="48.173">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.173" end="48.723">わす</span></span></span><span begin="48.723" end="49.243">れ</span><span begin="49.243" end="51.100">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.663" end="51.993">なが</span></span></span><span begin="51.993" end="52.433">さ</span><span begin="52.433" end="52.653">れ</span><span begin="52.653" end="52.940">て</span><span begin="52.940" end="53.333">い</span><span begin="53.333" end="55.340">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">连痛楚都已遗忘 随波逐流而去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itami sae mo wasurete nagasarete iku</span></p><p begin="57.693" end="1:17.440" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.693" end="58.200">「ど</span><span begin="58.200" end="58.563">う</span><span begin="58.563" end="59.463">し</span><span begin="59.463" end="1:00.183">て</span><span begin="1:00.183" end="1:00.543">こ</span><span begin="1:00.543" end="1:01.123">ん</span><span begin="1:01.123" end="1:01.600">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.600" end="1:02.300">ふう</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.300" end="1:02.943">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">作</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.943" end="1:03.883">つく</span></span></span><span begin="1:03.883" end="1:04.403">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.403" end="1:05.630">わら</span></span></span><span begin="1:06.120" end="1:06.680">い</span><span begin="1:06.680" end="1:07.303">を</span><span begin="1:07.303" end="1:07.913">し</span><span begin="1:07.913" end="1:08.963">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.963" end="1:10.033">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.033" end="1:10.443">き</span><span begin="1:10.443" end="1:11.763">て</span><span begin="1:11.763" end="1:12.903">ゆ</span><span begin="1:12.903" end="1:13.223">く</span><span begin="1:13.223" end="1:14.283">の</span><span begin="1:14.283" end="1:14.603">だ</span><span begin="1:14.603" end="1:15.420">ろ</span><span begin="1:15.420" end="1:17.440">う」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“为何非要像这样强颜欢笑地活下去呢”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dōshite konna fū ni tsukuriwarai o shite ikite yuku no darō</span></p><p begin="1:19.623" end="1:24.760" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">追</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.623" end="1:19.820">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:19.820" end="1:19.943">い</span><span begin="1:19.943" end="1:20.113">か</span><span begin="1:20.113" end="1:20.303">け</span><span begin="1:20.303" end="1:20.763">る</span><span begin="1:20.763" end="1:21.373">ほ</span><span begin="1:21.373" end="1:22.103">ど</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:22.103" end="1:23.163">とお</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.163" end="1:23.673">く</span><span begin="1:23.673" end="1:24.183">な</span><span begin="1:24.183" end="1:24.760">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">越是追逐便越是遥远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oikakeru hodo tōku naru</span></p><p begin="1:25.193" end="1:30.408" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.193" end="1:25.623">さき</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.623" end="1:25.803">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.803" end="1:25.960">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.960" end="1:26.523">え</span><span begin="1:26.523" end="1:27.020">な</span><span begin="1:27.020" end="1:27.773">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">毎</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.773" end="1:28.793">まい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.793" end="1:29.800">にち</span></span></span><span begin="1:29.800" end="1:30.408">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那看不清前路的每一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saki no mienai mainichi o</span></p><p begin="1:30.913" end="1:36.288" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.913" end="1:31.080">て</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.080" end="1:31.253">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">入</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.253" end="1:31.403">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.403" end="1:31.613">れ</span><span begin="1:31.613" end="1:32.153">た</span><span begin="1:32.153" end="1:32.703">く</span><span begin="1:32.703" end="1:33.680">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.680" end="1:33.873">くら</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">闇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.873" end="1:34.403">やみ</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.403" end="1:34.943">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.943" end="1:36.288">なか</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">渴望将它握在手中 在黑暗里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te ni iretakute kurayami no naka</span></p><p begin="1:36.853" end="1:41.780" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.853" end="1:37.053">ひ</span><span begin="1:37.053" end="1:37.240">と</span><span begin="1:37.240" end="1:37.603">つ</span><span begin="1:37.603" end="1:37.743">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.743" end="1:38.820">ひかり</span></span></span><span begin="1:38.820" end="1:39.133">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.133" end="1:39.743">さが</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.743" end="1:41.123">し</span><span begin="1:41.123" end="1:41.220">て</span><span begin="1:41.220" end="1:41.333">い</span><span begin="1:41.333" end="1:41.780">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">寻觅着那一缕光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsu no hikari o sagashite iru</span></p><p begin="1:42.143" end="1:47.460" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">青</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.143" end="1:42.523">あお</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.523" end="1:42.623">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">染</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.623" end="1:42.913">そ</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.913" end="1:43.953">まっ</span><span begin="1:43.953" end="1:44.713">た</span><span begin="1:44.713" end="1:45.363">こ</span><span begin="1:45.363" end="1:45.573">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.573" end="1:46.853">そら</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.853" end="1:47.460">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这片染上蔚蓝的天空里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aoku somatta kono sora ni</span></p><p begin="1:47.803" end="1:52.940" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.803" end="1:48.003">メ</span><span begin="1:48.003" end="1:48.183">ロ</span><span begin="1:48.183" end="1:48.540">ディー</span><span begin="1:48.540" end="1:49.003">を</span><span begin="1:49.003" end="1:49.653">ひ</span><span begin="1:49.653" end="1:50.313">と</span><span begin="1:50.313" end="1:50.820">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">浮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.820" end="1:51.413">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:51.413" end="1:51.933">か</span><span begin="1:51.933" end="1:52.473">べ</span><span begin="1:52.473" end="1:52.940">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">浮现出一段旋律</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">merodī o hitotsu ukabete</span></p><p begin="1:53.453" end="2:01.428" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.453" end="1:53.813">かぜ</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.813" end="1:53.983">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">奏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.983" end="1:54.723">かな</span></span></span><span begin="1:54.723" end="1:55.223">で</span><span begin="1:55.223" end="1:56.040">る</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.273" end="1:56.780">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.780" end="1:56.953">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">包</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.953" end="1:58.060">つつ</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.060" end="1:58.813">み</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">込</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.813" end="1:59.140">こ</span></span></span><span begin="1:59.140" end="1:59.503">ん</span><span begin="1:59.503" end="1:59.853">で</span><span begin="1:59.853" end="2:00.213">く</span><span begin="2:00.213" end="2:00.480">れ</span><span begin="2:00.480" end="2:01.428">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">微风轻轻奏响 将我温柔环抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kaze ga kanaderu watashi o tsutsumikonde kureru</span></p><p begin="2:01.903" end="2:09.280" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.903" end="2:02.193">明</span><span begin="2:02.193" end="2:03.180">日</span><span begin="2:03.180" end="2:03.703">へ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.703" end="2:04.433">つ</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.433" end="2:05.493">れ</span><span begin="2:05.493" end="2:06.200">て</span><span begin="2:06.200" end="2:06.583">い</span><span begin="2:06.583" end="2:09.280">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带我走向明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ashita e tsurete iku</span></p><p begin="2:33.380" end="2:38.620" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.380" end="2:33.743">ヘッ</span><span begin="2:33.743" end="2:34.100">ド</span><span begin="2:34.100" end="2:34.320">フォ</span><span begin="2:34.320" end="2:34.620">ン</span><span begin="2:34.620" end="2:34.960">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.960" end="2:35.520">なか</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.520" end="2:35.860">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.140" end="2:36.340">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:36.340" end="2:36.520">こ</span><span begin="2:36.520" end="2:36.860">え</span><span begin="2:36.860" end="2:37.040">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">叫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.040" end="2:37.780">さけ</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.780" end="2:38.100">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.100" end="2:38.620">ごえ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">耳机里传来的呐喊声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">heddofon no naka de kikoeru sakebigoe</span></p><p begin="2:38.980" end="2:44.100" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今、</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.980" end="2:41.160">いま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.680" end="2:42.200">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="2:42.200" end="2:42.520">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">突</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.520" end="2:42.720">つ</span></span></span><span begin="2:42.720" end="2:42.980">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">刺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.980" end="2:43.283">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:43.283" end="2:44.100">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">此刻深深刺痛着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ima, watashi o tsukisasu</span></p><p begin="2:44.653" end="2:50.158" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.653" end="2:45.003">なに</span></span></span><span begin="2:45.003" end="2:45.320">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.320" end="2:45.560">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:45.560" end="2:45.873">い</span><span begin="2:45.873" end="2:46.243">た</span><span begin="2:46.243" end="2:46.593">く</span><span begin="2:46.593" end="2:46.760">な</span><span begin="2:46.760" end="2:47.330">い</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.493" end="2:47.820">なに</span></span></span><span begin="2:47.820" end="2:48.163">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.163" end="2:48.363">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:48.363" end="2:48.693">き</span><span begin="2:48.693" end="2:49.060">た</span><span begin="2:49.060" end="2:49.443">く</span><span begin="2:49.443" end="2:49.640">な</span><span begin="2:49.640" end="2:50.158">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">什么都不想说 什么也不想听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo iitakunai nani mo kikitakunai</span></p><p begin="2:50.333" end="2:59.080" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.333" end="2:51.220">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="2:51.220" end="2:51.553">は</span><span begin="2:51.553" end="2:52.163">ど</span><span begin="2:52.163" end="2:52.503">こ</span><span begin="2:52.503" end="2:52.740">に</span><span begin="2:52.740" end="2:53.013">い</span><span begin="2:53.013" end="2:53.460">る</span><span begin="2:53.460" end="2:55.410">の？</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.953" end="2:56.280">こえ</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.280" end="2:56.633">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:56.633" end="2:56.863">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.863" end="2:57.033">か</span><span begin="2:57.033" end="2:57.503">せ</span><span begin="2:57.503" end="2:59.080">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我究竟身在何处？让我听听你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi wa doko ni iru no? koe o kikasete</span></p><p begin="3:01.613" end="3:06.820" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">途</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.613" end="3:01.993">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.993" end="3:02.480">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.480" end="3:03.013">れ</span><span begin="3:03.013" end="3:03.753">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.753" end="3:04.823">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.823" end="3:05.333">ば</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.333" end="3:06.333">さが</span></span></span><span begin="3:06.333" end="3:06.533">し</span><span begin="3:06.533" end="3:06.820">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">寻觅着断续的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">togireta kotoba sagashite</span></p><p begin="3:07.193" end="3:12.500" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">街</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.193" end="3:08.133">まち</span></span></span><span begin="3:08.133" end="3:08.643">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">迷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.643" end="3:10.360">まよ</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.360" end="3:10.953">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">込</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.953" end="3:11.280">こ</span></span></span><span begin="3:11.280" end="3:11.493">ん</span><span begin="3:11.493" end="3:11.980">だ</span><span begin="3:11.980" end="3:12.183">ん</span><span begin="3:12.183" end="3:12.500">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">迷失在街道之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">machi ni mayoikonda n da</span></p><p begin="3:12.903" end="3:21.898" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.903" end="3:14.173">裸</span><span begin="3:14.173" end="3:14.713">足</span><span begin="3:14.713" end="3:16.013">の</span><span begin="3:16.013" end="3:17.360">ま</span><span begin="3:17.360" end="3:18.893">ま</span><span begin="3:18.893" end="3:21.898">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就那样赤着双脚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hadashi no mama de</span></p><p begin="3:23.823" end="3:34.580" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.823" end="3:23.943">「ど</span><span begin="3:23.943" end="3:24.183">ん</span><span begin="3:24.183" end="3:24.343">な</span><span begin="3:24.343" end="3:24.543">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.543" end="3:26.273">なみだ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.273" end="3:27.183">なが</span></span></span><span begin="3:27.183" end="3:27.823">し</span><span begin="3:27.823" end="3:28.403">て</span><span begin="3:28.403" end="3:29.280">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">新</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:29.280" end="3:29.733">あたら</span></span></span><span begin="3:29.733" end="3:29.970">し</span><span begin="3:29.970" end="3:30.160">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">朝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.160" end="3:31.213">あさ</span></span></span><span begin="3:31.213" end="3:31.913">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">巡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.913" end="3:33.003">めぐ</span></span></span><span begin="3:33.003" end="3:33.553">る</span><span begin="3:33.553" end="3:34.033">か</span><span begin="3:34.033" end="3:34.580">ら」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“无论流下多少眼泪 崭新的清晨终会来临”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">donna ni namida nagashite mo atarashii asa ga meguru kara</span></p><p begin="3:35.073" end="3:40.648" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.073" end="3:35.280">じゅ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">文</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.280" end="3:35.643">もん</span></span></span><span begin="3:35.643" end="3:35.803">み</span><span begin="3:35.803" end="3:36.320">た</span><span begin="3:36.320" end="3:36.923">い</span><span begin="3:36.923" end="3:37.740">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">繰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:37.740" end="3:37.913">く</span></span></span><span begin="3:37.913" end="3:38.063">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">返</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:38.063" end="3:38.380">かえ</span></span></span><span begin="3:38.380" end="3:38.603">す</span><span begin="3:38.603" end="3:39.233">け</span><span begin="3:39.233" end="3:39.673">れ</span><span begin="3:39.673" end="3:40.648">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽如咒语般不断重复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jumon mitai ni kurikaesu keredo</span></p><p begin="3:41.113" end="3:45.920" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.113" end="3:41.293">か</span></span></span><span begin="3:41.293" end="3:41.460">わ</span><span begin="3:41.460" end="3:41.833">ら</span><span begin="3:41.833" end="3:42.000">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">朝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.000" end="3:42.663">あさ</span></span></span><span begin="3:42.663" end="3:43.073">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">巡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.073" end="3:43.783">めぐ</span></span></span><span begin="3:43.783" end="3:44.093">る</span><span begin="3:44.093" end="3:45.293">だ</span><span begin="3:45.293" end="3:45.503">け</span><span begin="3:45.503" end="3:45.920">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">迎来的却只是一成不变的清晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawaranu asa ga meguru dake de</span></p><p begin="3:46.373" end="3:51.480" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">壁</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.373" end="3:46.720">かべ</span></span></span><span begin="3:46.720" end="3:46.923">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">壊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.923" end="3:47.513">こわ</span></span></span><span begin="3:47.513" end="3:48.153">し</span><span begin="3:48.153" end="3:48.873">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.873" end="3:49.553">て</span></span></span><span begin="3:49.553" end="3:49.900">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">入</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.900" end="3:50.380">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:50.380" end="3:51.003">れ</span><span begin="3:51.003" end="3:51.480">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">打破高墙 将它握在手中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kabe o kowashite te ni irete</span></p><p begin="3:52.063" end="3:57.120" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:52.063" end="3:52.243">ま</span><span begin="3:52.243" end="3:52.403">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:52.403" end="3:52.503">ほ</span></span></span><span begin="3:52.503" end="3:52.803">し</span><span begin="3:52.803" end="3:53.833">がっ</span><span begin="3:53.833" end="3:54.500">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:54.500" end="3:55.520">ゆめ</span></span></span><span begin="3:55.520" end="3:56.093">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:56.093" end="3:56.600">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:56.600" end="3:57.120">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">却又心生渴求 继续追梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mata hoshigatte yume o miru</span></p><p begin="3:57.620" end="4:02.823" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.620" end="3:58.033">いま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">取</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.033" end="3:58.183">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:58.183" end="3:58.383">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">返</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.383" end="3:59.313">かえ</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.313" end="4:00.300">す</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">新</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.300" end="4:00.793">あたら</span></span></span><span begin="4:00.793" end="4:01.030">し</span><span begin="4:01.030" end="4:01.220">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">朝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:01.220" end="4:02.200">あさ</span></span></span><span begin="4:02.200" end="4:02.823">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">此刻夺回 那崭新的清晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ima torikaesu atarashii asa o</span></p><p begin="4:02.823" end="4:13.440" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:02.823" end="4:03.233">そ</span><span begin="4:03.233" end="4:03.683">し</span><span begin="4:03.683" end="4:04.040">て、</span><span begin="4:04.040" end="4:04.373">い</span><span begin="4:04.373" end="4:04.733">つ</span><span begin="4:04.733" end="4:05.550">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.043" end="4:06.893">そら</span></span></span><span begin="4:06.893" end="4:07.373">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">放</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.373" end="4:08.633">はな</span></span></span><span begin="4:08.633" end="4:09.353">て</span><span begin="4:09.353" end="4:09.640">る</span><span begin="4:09.640" end="4:10.060">よ</span><span begin="4:10.060" end="4:10.773">う</span><span begin="4:10.773" end="4:13.440">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只愿有一天 能向着天空尽情释放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soshite, itsuka sora ni hanateru yō ni</span></p><p begin="4:56.980" end="5:02.220" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">追</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:56.980" end="4:57.200">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:57.200" end="4:57.343">い</span><span begin="4:57.343" end="4:57.493">か</span><span begin="4:57.493" end="4:57.713">け</span><span begin="4:57.713" end="4:58.283">る</span><span begin="4:58.283" end="4:58.763">ほ</span><span begin="4:58.763" end="4:59.463">ど</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:59.463" end="5:00.553">とお</span></span></span><span begin="5:00.553" end="5:01.073">く</span><span begin="5:01.073" end="5:01.563">な</span><span begin="5:01.563" end="5:02.220">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">越是追逐便越是遥远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oikakeru hodo tōku naru</span></p><p begin="5:02.593" end="5:07.740" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:02.593" end="5:03.013">さき</span></span></span><span begin="5:03.013" end="5:03.193">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:03.193" end="5:03.340">み</span></span></span><span begin="5:03.340" end="5:03.893">え</span><span begin="5:03.893" end="5:04.380">な</span><span begin="5:04.380" end="5:05.133">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">毎</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:05.133" end="5:06.143">まい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:06.143" end="5:07.160">にち</span></span></span><span begin="5:07.160" end="5:07.740">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那看不清前路的每一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saki no mienai mainichi o</span></p><p begin="5:08.283" end="5:13.828" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:08.283" end="5:08.483">て</span></span></span><span begin="5:08.483" end="5:08.640">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">入</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:08.640" end="5:08.783">い</span></span></span><span begin="5:08.783" end="5:08.973">れ</span><span begin="5:08.973" end="5:09.513">た</span><span begin="5:09.513" end="5:10.053">く</span><span begin="5:10.053" end="5:10.800">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:11.113" end="5:11.420">くら</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">闇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:11.420" end="5:11.803">やみ</span></span></span><span begin="5:11.803" end="5:12.313">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:12.313" end="5:13.828">なか</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">渴望将它握在手中 在黑暗里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te ni iretakute kurayami no naka</span></p><p begin="5:14.253" end="5:19.100" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:14.253" end="5:14.443">ひ</span><span begin="5:14.443" end="5:14.603">と</span><span begin="5:14.603" end="5:14.993">つ</span><span begin="5:14.993" end="5:15.203">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:15.203" end="5:16.200">ひかり</span></span></span><span begin="5:16.200" end="5:16.513">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:16.513" end="5:17.093">さが</span></span></span><span begin="5:17.093" end="5:18.503">し</span><span begin="5:18.503" end="5:18.610">て</span><span begin="5:18.610" end="5:18.703">い</span><span begin="5:18.703" end="5:19.100">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">寻觅着那一缕光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsu no hikari o sagashite iru</span></p><p begin="5:19.500" end="5:24.760" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">青</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:19.500" end="5:19.770">あお</span></span></span><span begin="5:19.770" end="5:19.983">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">染</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:19.983" end="5:20.293">そ</span></span></span><span begin="5:20.293" end="5:21.343">まっ</span><span begin="5:21.343" end="5:22.063">た</span><span begin="5:22.063" end="5:22.733">こ</span><span begin="5:22.733" end="5:22.963">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:22.963" end="5:24.213">そら</span></span></span><span begin="5:24.213" end="5:24.760">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这片染上蔚蓝的天空里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aoku somatta kono sora ni</span></p><p begin="5:25.273" end="5:30.348" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:25.273" end="5:25.433">メ</span><span begin="5:25.433" end="5:25.603">ロ</span><span begin="5:25.603" end="5:25.940">ディー</span><span begin="5:25.940" end="5:26.533">を</span><span begin="5:26.533" end="5:27.013">ひ</span><span begin="5:27.013" end="5:27.660">と</span><span begin="5:27.660" end="5:28.440">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">浮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:28.440" end="5:28.783">う</span></span></span><span begin="5:28.783" end="5:29.293">か</span><span begin="5:29.293" end="5:29.813">べ</span><span begin="5:29.813" end="5:30.348">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">浮现出一段旋律</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">merodī o hitotsu ukabete</span></p><p begin="5:30.873" end="5:38.788" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:30.873" end="5:31.223">かぜ</span></span></span><span begin="5:31.223" end="5:31.393">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">奏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:31.393" end="5:32.133">かな</span></span></span><span begin="5:32.133" end="5:32.723">で</span><span begin="5:32.723" end="5:33.220">る</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:33.663" end="5:34.200">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="5:34.200" end="5:34.403">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">包</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:34.403" end="5:35.433">つつ</span></span></span><span begin="5:35.433" end="5:36.133">み</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">込</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:36.133" end="5:36.500">こ</span></span></span><span begin="5:36.500" end="5:36.843">ん</span><span begin="5:36.843" end="5:37.180">で</span><span begin="5:37.180" end="5:37.583">く</span><span begin="5:37.583" end="5:37.863">れ</span><span begin="5:37.863" end="5:38.788">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">微风轻轻奏响 将我温柔环抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kaze ga kanaderu watashi o tsutsumikonde kureru</span></p><p begin="5:39.323" end="5:47.158" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:39.323" end="5:39.593">明</span><span begin="5:39.593" end="5:40.640">日</span><span begin="5:40.640" end="5:41.113">へ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:41.113" end="5:41.883">つ</span></span></span><span begin="5:41.883" end="5:42.903">れ</span><span begin="5:42.903" end="5:43.600">て</span><span begin="5:43.600" end="5:43.973">い</span><span begin="5:43.973" end="5:47.158">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带我走向明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ashita e tsurete iku</span></p></div></body></tt>